Raid round-up
</div>
<div class='bodytable' style='text-align:left'>
<a href='news.php?cat.1'><img style='float: left; border:0'  src='e107_themes/nordranious/images/bullet1.gif' alt='' /></a>
A very busy week saw Nordlys raiding all over Norrath, downing multiple targets each night and having great fun doing it.<br />
<br />
Mobs that fell to the might of Nordlys this week include....<br />
<br />
<b>Cazic Thule</b> - gratz Jardana on getting a <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=5513">Brain of Cazic Thule</a>, Livak on getting a <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=5374">Robe of Inspiration</a>, Harmish on getting <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=5454">Pauldrons of Ferocity</a> and Gamolron on getting a <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=5221">Fearsome Shield</a>.<br />
<br />
<b>Banord Paffa</b>, once again dropping a <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16662">Veil of Bile</a> which went to Jekiza.<br />
<br />
Our good old friend <b>Derakor the Vindicator</b>, who was kind enough to give a <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=5521">Chestplate of Vindication</a> to Osmunius.<br />
<br />
<b>Xanamech</b>, who dropped in a flawless raid and left a <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16477">Woven Shim Choker</a> for Tarrod and an <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16478">Innovator's Ring</a> for Gerbyl.<br />
<br />
Another old friend, the <b>Itraer Vius</b> - gratz Vamael on getting a <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=7532">Collar of Tavuel Xakreum</a>.<br />
<br />
As an appetising starter course one raid night we decided to see <b>Mr Rumblecrush and his associate Mrs Doomshade</b>.  Despite our best efforts to wipe on Doomshade, they both went to sleep like good little boys and girls, and left us with a <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=8996">Chooser's Cap</a> and a <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=10384">Dark Master Chestplate</a> for Harmonic, a <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=8996">Tunic of Kinship</a> for Tiffin, a <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=10444">Crystal Enervated Armband</a> for Pleasura, a <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=8994">Darkblood Sword</a> for Granthyr and lastly a <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=9011">Longsword of Freedom</a> for Nuckles.<br />
<br />
And lastly we decided to visit our favourite hunting grounds at the moment, the BoT towers.  <b>Auliffe Chaoswind</b> was kind enough to give an <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=21394">Ornate Leather Tunic Pattern</a> to Tumling, which after the combine will become a <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=17273">Tunic of the Khati Sha</a>.  He also gave a <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=17279">Wand of the Ice Storm</a> to Aylmer.<br />
<br />
Lastly, <b>Eindride Icestorm</b> went down without a fuss, and enabled Gonaddor to finally spend some of his massive haul of DKP points.  His reward was a <a href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=18553">Mantle of the Rainmaker</a>.<br />
<br />
Gratz to all who got drops, its been a great week.

